/* == 5.5e · Settings pages: layout review (R2a) == */
/* A pass over every settings page at every scroll position (1440 / 1280 / 390). Fixes what
   §5.5b left in ST's own look or too tight: heading bars, the top of 生成参数, toolbars that
   were cut on narrow screens, three-column pages squeezed into the window, label / control
   gaps. Still CSS only (rule 1); nothing here forces display on a control ST hides. */
@media screen { /* desktop + phone (§5.9b overrides the geometry) */
