    /* creator's notes: ST's own #spoiler_free_desc block (header + content + its two
       function buttons), restyled as an AG2 group card. R2b: the old rule only painted
       the OUTER block, so ST's .standoutHeader gradient bar, its circled chevron and
       the black bordered content box showed through; worse, the `display:none` was
       scoped to [data-ag2-insp="char"], so ST's fresh “new character” editor (create
       view) leaked the whole native block. Now: hidden in every inspector view, shown
       only for the open character when the user asked for it (char + [data-ag2-notes]),
       and every inner node reset to AG2 styling. */
    html body.ag2.ag2-insp-open:not(#_):not(#__) #right-nav-panel #spoiler_free_desc {
        display: none !important;
    }

    html body.ag2.ag2-insp-open:not(#_):not(#__) #right-nav-panel[data-ag2-insp="char"][data-ag2-notes] #spoiler_free_desc {
